		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Wholesale · Week 33</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e00006" class="e-ykrhga-e00006-s e-heading-base">What is actually good this week, from 90 minutes away.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00007-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00007">Field to Pass puts independent kitchens straight onto 46 growers, dairies and smokehouses within 90 minutes of the city. Order by 9pm, it is at your back door by 6am.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00009"><a href="#account" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Open a kitchen account
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000a">No minimum order · 14-day terms after three weeks</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000b-s " data-id="e0000b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c">On the board today</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d"><strong>Week 33:</strong> Crown Prince squash, the last of the Gariguette strawberries, sea kale from the coast, three-week-aged mutton, and a goat curd that will not last past Thursday.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000g-s " data-id="e0000g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000h">This week's filmstrip</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000i" class="e-ykrhga-e0000i-s e-heading-base">Fourteen things at their best.</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">Scroll the strip →  every frame carries the farm, the distance and when it was cut.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000k-s " data-id="e0000k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000l-s " data-id="e0000l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000m-s " data-id="e0000m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">38 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000o" class="e-ykrhga-e0000o-s e-heading-base">Crown Prince squash</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000p">Hollow Lane Market Garden</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000q">Cured three weeks. Cuts dry, roasts sweet.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000r-s " data-id="e0000r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000s">44 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000t" class="e-ykrhga-e0000t-s e-heading-base">Gariguette strawberries</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">Ryeburn Fruit</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">The last picking of the year. Thursday ends it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000x">88 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0000y" class="e-ykrhga-e0000y-s e-heading-base">Sea kale</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000z">Coast Rows</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00010-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00010">Blanched under pots, cut Tuesday at dawn.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00012-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00012">72 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00013" class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-heading-base">Three-week mutton</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">Blackthorn Hill</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00015-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00015">Hung 21 days. Saddle, shoulder, whole sides.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00016 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00016-s " data-id="e00016" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00016">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00017-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00017">29 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00018" class="e-ykrhga-e00018-s e-heading-base">Goat curd</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00019-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00019">Sallow Dairy</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001a">Set Monday. Will not last past Thursday.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001b-s " data-id="e0001b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001c">51 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001d" class="e-ykrhga-e0001d-s e-heading-base">Cavolo nero</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001e">Ninepence Farm</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">First frost has been through it. Sweeter for it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001h">63 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001i" class="e-ykrhga-e0001i-s e-heading-base">Green cobnuts</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001j">Marsh End</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001k">Milky, still in the husk. Two weeks at most.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001m">47 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001n" class="e-ykrhga-e0001n-s e-heading-base">Borlotti beans</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001o">Whitewell Holding</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001p">Podding weight. Shell them the day they land.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001q-s " data-id="e0001q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001r">66 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001s" class="e-ykrhga-e0001s-s e-heading-base">Damsons</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001t">Old Vicarage Orchard</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001u">Picked over twice. Then it is jam and nothing else.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001v-s " data-id="e0001v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001w">81 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001x" class="e-ykrhga-e0001x-s e-heading-base">Cold-smoked trout</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001y">Aln Smokehouse</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001z">Oak, fourteen hours. Sides or sliced to order.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00020 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00020-s " data-id="e00020" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00020">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00021-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00021">34 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00022" class="e-ykrhga-e00022-s e-heading-base">Salad burnet and chervil</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00023-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00023">Fen Cutting</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00024-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00024">Cut the night before, boxed damp.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00025 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00025-s " data-id="e00025" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00025">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00026-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00026">74 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00027" class="e-ykrhga-e00027-s e-heading-base">Chanterelles</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00028-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00028">Gorse Wood</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00029-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00029">Foraged Sunday and Wednesday only. Nothing between.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002a-s " data-id="e0002a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002b">29 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002c" class="e-ykrhga-e0002c-s e-heading-base">Raw milk butter</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002d">Sallow Dairy</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002e">Churned Tuesday, cultured eighteen hours.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002f-s " data-id="e0002f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002g">72 km</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002h" class="e-ykrhga-e0002h-s e-heading-base">Ox cheek</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002i">Blackthorn Hill</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002j">Whole, trimmed, six to a box. Braising weather.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002k-s " data-id="e0002k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002k">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0002l-s" data-interaction-id="e0002l" id="88" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-produce_strip.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-produce_strip.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-produce_strip-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-produce_strip-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="A row of seasonal produce laid out across a bench"/>		
