			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004c">Leaf and stem crops, field-grown, no polytunnels.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004d-s " data-id="e0004d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004e-s " data-id="e0004e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004e">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004f" class="e-ykrhga-e0004f-s e-heading-base">Fen Cutting</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004g">34 km</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004h">Soft herbs and salad, cut to order.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004i">…and 38 more, from a two-acre herb cutting at 34km to a smokehouse on the coast at 88km.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004j-s " data-id="e0004j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004k-s " data-id="e0004k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">Pricing</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004n" class="e-ykrhga-e0004n-s e-heading-base">The grower sets the price and sees it.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004o">We add 14 percent and that is the whole model. No listing fees, no shelf placement, no promoted produce. The number on the listing is the number the farm wrote down.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004p-s " data-id="e0004p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004q-s " data-id="e0004q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004r">100%</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004s">of the listed price goes to the grower</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004t-s " data-id="e0004t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">14%</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004v">added on top, and nothing else</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004x-s " data-id="e0004x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004y-s " data-id="e0004y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004z-s " data-id="e0004z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00050-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00050">Ordering</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00051" class="e-ykrhga-e00051-s e-heading-base">Web, WhatsApp or a phone call.</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00052-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00052">Chefs order at odd hours from odd places. All three routes hit the same 9pm cut-off.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00056" class="e-ykrhga-e00056-s e-heading-base">On the web</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">The full list, updated as growers cut. Reorder last week in two clicks, edit until 9pm.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005a" class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-heading-base">On WhatsApp</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Send a photo of your list or a voice note. It comes back typed for you to confirm before cut-off.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005e" class="e-ykrhga-e0005e-s e-heading-base">On the phone</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005f">Ring the desk between 7am and 9pm and a person picks up. They know what is good this week.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s" data-interaction-id="e0005g" id="87" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-kitchen_prep.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-kitchen_prep.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-kitchen_prep-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-field-to-pass-kitchen_prep-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Chef prepping vegetables on a restaurant pass at first light"/>		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005h-s " data-id="e0005h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005i-s " data-id="e0005i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">Substitutions and shortages</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005l" class="e-ykrhga-e0005l-s e-heading-base">If a crop fails we call you before 10pm, not at 5am.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">You approve any substitution or you get a credit. We have never silently swapped an item and we would rather lose the order.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">Before 10pm</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">A call, from a person, the night the pick list breaks.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005r-s " data-id="e0005r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">Your call</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t">Approve the swap, take the credit, or cancel the line.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">Never silent</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">No box has ever arrived with something you did not agree to.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005x-s " data-id="e0005x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005y-s " data-id="e0005y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060">Credit terms for restaurants</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00061" class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-heading-base">14-day terms after three delivered weeks.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00062">No minimum order, though under 60 there is a 6 delivery charge. One invoice a week, itemised by farm, so your GP work takes twenty minutes instead of an evening.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00063 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00063-s " data-id="e00063" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00063">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065">14 days</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00066">to settle</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00067 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00067-s " data-id="e00067" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00067">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068">0</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00069-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00069">minimum order</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006b">6</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006c">under a 60 basket</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006d-s " data-id="e0006d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006d" id="account">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006e-s " data-id="e0006e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006f">Open a kitchen account</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006g" class="e-ykrhga-e0006g-s e-heading-base">Order tonight, unpack it at six.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006h">Give us the kitchen name, a delivery door and someone who answers a phone after service. Accounts open the same week and the first order can go in the same evening.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006i"><a href="#account" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Open a kitchen account
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006j">Field to Pass · 46 growers within 90 minutes · cut-off 9pm, delivery 4–6am</p>
		
</div>

</section>

</div>
